            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Galaana Kushi gama suni lafa tokoti jira ta wobbeesa koola d'agayani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa suni keesa jara ergani tokoti, jira, ka hobolo ilaaduni mid'aasanini bisaani galaana gubba yau. Isani, jari ergattu kunini, ka yoosu armaani bahe, kaa gala! Lafa teesani ta galaani gargari kute, ta gochiti jabduuni irre qabdu keesa teetu, ta nama d'ed'eera nafi qulqullicha, ka nami lafa ch'ufa sodaatu qabdu d'aamsa kanaani iti gala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani nami lafa keesa jiru ch'ufti ch'aqasa! Fiit'e gaareeni gubbaa baandera old'aabani ilaani barbaada! Magalata d'au jirani ch'aqasa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan nani jed'e, Akuma fit'eesi hojja mid'aani murani halkani laanuma d'ufu, yokhaani akuma aduuni guyya gudda aka male owitu, anini akasuma laanuma gubbaa gadi laala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato mid'aani zabibu inguurre, ka daraaraani ch'ufi bue mid'aani bilchaachu jirani, nyaapi d'ufe worra Kushi suni balleesa, akuma billa, dame mukha zabibu yoosu kutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reefa duula worraa allaatifi bineensa alaati lakisani. Allaatini bona hagayya reefa suni nyaate, adolesa bineensi nyaata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaani ind'ufa, ka AABBO Waaqi lafa galaani gargari kutu ta gochiti jabduuni irre qabdu keesa teetu, ta nama d'ed'eera nafi qulqullicha, ka nami lafa ch'ufti sodaatu qabdu, woi iraa fud'atu. Worri suni gaara Sioni fulla AABBO Waaqa gudda iti kad'atani, d'ufa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Waaqi lafa Misiri gaargalchu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
